waymo,2023-11,931491,7921491,7501652,8321526,465746,1397236,1,1,1,1,1,1,"US est.: CA CPUC driverless VMT scaled to US via cumulative milestone intervals (IGNOREME.md, Waymo VMT Methodology); level re-baselined -2.824M so the published milestones of these months (9.3M end-2023, 22M Jun-2024, 25M Jul-2024, 50M end-2024, 56.7M Jan-2025) are exact centrals minus ~0.15M pre-series miles, not floors. The later Mar/Jun/Sep-2025 anchors are no longer the 71M/96M/127M milestones: since the 2026-08-28 re-chain each is the Waymo Safety Impact hub's All-Locations total plus an estimate of rider-only miles in metros the hub had not yet benchmarked, less the ~0.15M (71.47M end-Mar-2025, 96.52M end-Jun-2025 and 129.01M end-Sep-2025; data/README.md, Waymo anchors); these rows' own numbers predate that re-chain and are unchanged."
