waymo,2024-06,2501777,21850000,21850000,22056500,1856836,3353218,1,1,1,1,1,1,"US est.: June 2024's monthly central is kept. Its cumulative band now comes from the 22.199M miles Waymo published, less the same ~150,000 pre-series miles and widened for that figure's rounding and Mountain View's omitted miles, and it still holds the earlier central; the month's band is reconciled with it (data/README.md, Waymo monthly allocation)."
waymo,2024-07,3000000,24850000,24850000,25165500,2793500,3315500,1,1,1,1,1,1,"US est.: each month's California part is CPUC's measured driverless miles (data/waymo-ca.csv); the rest (other states, and California miles outside CPUC's scope) is allocated between Waymo's published cumulative totals, with daily rates interpolated linearly and each interval's total kept. Only the rest carries allocation uncertainty, and the monthly and cumulative bands agree with each other. The bands are model estimates, not validated US probability intervals (data/README.md, Waymo monthly allocation)."
